SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- LI Mill 72 and Trolley Line Coffee (30R) C/D Pace-- RSV
 P required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating sta
 rt location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile rout
 es\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for r
 efreshment/coffee mid-route at either [Mill 72 Bake Shop](https://mill72.c
 om/) or [Trolley Line Coffee](https://trolleylinecoffee.com/)\n\nLike an A
 ll Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a single pace.\nAs Sweep\, Rick Zo
 ok will bike with any "D" ride cyclist.\nThe CoffeeTue rides are social ri
 des\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may ped
 al at their own comfortable paces. A planned stop to regroup is recommende
 d. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone
  or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, 
 and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](https://routes.lancasterb
 ikeclub.net/cue/li-mill-72-and-trolley-line-coffee-30r/)\n\nHelmets are ma
 ndatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tub
 e\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen
  and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below t
 o join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. 
 [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club
 _id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code o
 f Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&cl
 ub_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclu
 b.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
  \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\n
 In case of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.amazonaws
 .com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_12335742
 8.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&response-cont
 ent-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&Signatur
 e=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
