SUMMARY:Impromptu: WH Sundae Evening Social (19F) 11-12mph
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n11-12 MPH\, no one will b
 e left behind. Re-grouping stops as needed.\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nS
 weep: Cathleen Anderson\n\nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRoute:\n
 [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/wh-sundae-evening-social-19f/](h
 ttps://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/wh-sundae-evening-social-19f/)\n\n
 The ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed. This is intende
 d to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader
  will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupin
 gs and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. Please do not join th
 is ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the p
 osted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faste
 r group.\n\nIf maintaining a 11-12 mph average is beyond your current abil
 ity level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are ma
 ndatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube
 \, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen 
 and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to
  join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.\n\nJ
 oin @ Lancasterbikeclub.net -Member Signup. Your RSVP is your agreement to
  abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduct Guidance if an incid
 ent occurs: Incident Actions
