SUMMARY:Paul Jacobs Memorial Ride
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Memorial Ride for Paul 
 Jacobs**\n\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/33326850\n\nPlease join us for 
 a memorial bike ride honoring the life and spirit of **Paul Jacobs**—a d
 evoted friend\, passionate cyclist\, gifted photographer\, and beloved mem
 ber of our community.\n\nPaul passed away on **June 21st\, 2025**\, follow
 ing a sudden diagnosis of multiple myeloma. Born in **Shirati\, Tanzania**
 \, and a graduate of **Hempfield High School** and **Millersville Universi
 ty**\, Paul built a life centered around creativity\, adventure\, and conn
 ection. As the founder of **Paul Jacobs Photography**\, his talent capture
 d countless cherished moments—and his adventurous heart led him into nat
 ure as often as possible\, whether by bike\, on foot\, or backpacking in t
 he coldest months of the year.\n\nLet’s ride in Paul’s honor\, surroun
 ded by the community\, nature\, and friendship he loved so deeply.
